    "detailed_description": "Banshee Hunt is a Banshee hunting horror game, a supernatural creature that has announced that you will die. Can you kill her and change your destiny or are you doomed to die?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong></h2>The Banshee is a supernatural spirit of unknown origin that announces the death of living beings by shouting or crying. One night, the Banshee announced that you would die, and you decided not to accept it, starting a relentless hunt for the Banshee, to prevent your tragic fate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Banshee</strong>: A supernatural spirit from Irish folklore that announces death by shouting or crying.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/eb388cf7559c7134f83ab5777d819740.poster.avif?t=1725035972\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/eb388cf7559c7134f83ab5777d819740.webm?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/eb388cf7559c7134f83ab5777d819740.mp4?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Terrifying Enemies</strong>: Enemies roam the island looking for living beings to kill.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/e268c0b97b93f814932dcc488e1f2a9c.poster.avif?t=1725035972\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/e268c0b97b93f814932dcc488e1f2a9c.webm?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/e268c0b97b93f814932dcc488e1f2a9c.mp4?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong>: Kill with up to 9 different weapons hidden across the map.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/a5a4e4d2d1d8b60933f0c8c654c691fb.poster.avif?t=1725035972\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/a5a4e4d2d1d8b60933f0c8c654c691fb.webm?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/a5a4e4d2d1d8b60933f0c8c654c691fb.mp4?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Find and manage health syringes and ammo to stay alive.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/cfbf8f15475152e6c2f5922bc45c5112.poster.avif?t=1725035972\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/cfbf8f15475152e6c2f5922bc45c5112.webm?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/cfbf8f15475152e6c2f5922bc45c5112.mp4?t=1725035972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Night Vision Goggles</strong>: Wear night vision goggles to see better in the dark.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661470/extras/3f3416c2e12c2c0dc77be6e573fae9d1.poster.avif?t=1725035972\" width=616 height